 * Mutable state threaded across successive calls to {@link translateEvent}.
 *
 * A single {@link TranslationState} corresponds to one agent stream. It tracks
 * whether the `agent_start` event has been emitted, the currently-selected
 * model, a monotonically increasing counter used to mint unique event ids, and
 * the names of tool calls that are awaiting a response (so the response can be
